.TH "TIMEEVENT" "3JS" "May 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
TimeEvent \- TimeEvent
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]TimeEvent\f[B]\f[R] interface, a part of SVG SMIL
animation, provides specific contextual information associated with Time
events.
.SH INSTANCE PROPERTIES
.TP
\f[B]TimeEvent.detail\f[R] \f[I](read\-only)\f[R]
A \f[CR]long\f[R] that specifies some detail information about the
Event, depending on the type of the event.
For this event type, indicates the repeat number for the animation.
.TP
\f[B]TimeEvent.view\f[R] \f[I](read\-only)\f[R]
A WindowProxy that identifies the Window from which the event was
generated.
.SH INSTANCE METHODS
.TP
\f[B]TimeEvent.initTimeEvent()\f[R]
Initializes the value of a \f[CR]TimeEvent\f[R] created using
\f[CR]Document.createEvent()\f[R].
